List Flux resources (defaults to all)

Usage:
  flate get [flags]
  flate get [command]

Available Commands:
  all         List every Kustomization and HelmRelease
  hr          List HelmReleases
  images      List container images across the cluster
  ks          List Kustomizations

Flags:
      --allow-missing-kinds strings                  Tolerate missing input kinds (comma-separated values) [env: FLATE_ALLOW_MISSING_KINDS]
  -a, --api-versions string                          Set Helm cluster APIs (comma-separated values) [env: FLATE_API_VERSIONS]
      --base string                                  Compare with a Git revision (exclusive with --path-orig) [env: FLATE_BASE]
      --cache-dir string                             Store fetched sources and renders in this directory [env: FLATE_CACHE_DIR]
      --concurrency int                              Limit parallel reconciles (0 means unbounded) [env: FLATE_CONCURRENCY] (default <CONCURRENCY_DEFAULT>)
      --disable-chart-digest-tracking[=true|false]   Omit digest suffixes from OCI chart versions [env: FLATE_DISABLE_CHART_DIGEST_TRACKING]
      --enable-dns[=true|false]                      Enable DNS lookups in Helm templates [env: FLATE_ENABLE_DNS]
      --git-depth int                                Set Git fetch depth (0 means full history) [env: FLATE_GIT_DEPTH] (default 1)
  -h, --help[=true|false]                            help for get
      --kube-version string                          Set the cluster Kubernetes version for Helm [env: FLATE_KUBE_VERSION] (default "1.37.2")
  -n, --namespace string                             Select resources in this namespace [env: FLATE_NAMESPACE]
  -o, --output string                                Emit: table, yaml, json, name [env: FLATE_OUTPUT] (default "table")
  -p, --path string                                  Read Flux manifests from this directory [env: FLATE_PATH] (default ".")
  -P, --path-orig string                             Compare with a baseline directory (exclusive with --base) [env: FLATE_PATH_ORIG]
      --registry-config string                       Read OCI credentials from a native Docker or Helm store [env: FLATE_REGISTRY_CONFIG]
      --restrict-egress[=true|false]                 Block private-address fetches and local Git transports [env: FLATE_RESTRICT_EGRESS]
      --skip-kinds strings                           Exclude output kinds (comma-separated values) [env: FLATE_SKIP_KINDS] (default [Secret,CustomResourceDefinition])
      --strict-substitutions[=true|false]            Reject undefined substitutions without defaults [env: FLATE_STRICT_SUBSTITUTIONS]
      --supply stringArray                           Read reference-only YAML objects (repeatable flag) [env: FLATE_SUPPLY]

Global Flags:
      --log-level string           Set log level: debug,info,warn,error [env: FLATE_LOG_LEVEL] (default "error")
      --no-progress[=true|false]   Hide live progress on stderr [env: FLATE_NO_PROGRESS]

Use "flate get [command] --help" for more information about a command.
